[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ど、どうも！\u3000今年の星誕の使者役を務める\nレスナ・シュテルネンリヒトとイザナちゃんです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hello! We're this year's Starbirth Messengers—Resna Sternenlicht and Izana!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこはアタシもイザナ・ココシュカって\n紹介してくれないと釣り合いが取れないよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you could at least introduce me as Izana Kokoschka too! That's not fair!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、ネタのつもりじゃなかったんですけど……\nそれよりお待ちかねのプレゼントを配りますね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, I wasn't trying to make a joke... Anyway, time to hand out those presents everyone's been waiting for!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "贈り物……その袋には何が入っているのですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gifts... What is inside those bags?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……開けてみてのお楽しみです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's... a surprise! You'll have to open it to find out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（まさか私も知らないなんて言えないし……\n\u3000アンチュちゃんとワルターさんが作ったものだから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(It's not like I can tell them I don't know either... Antje and Walther made them, after all.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どれどれ、では早速御開帳……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, let us see what we have here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわーっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしやこれは、ナンパ者が開けると災いが起きる袋！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could this be a bag that brings misfortune to philanderers who open it?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだいその限定的な嫌がらせは！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What kind of oddly specific curse is that?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、火事だー！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "F-fire!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "客Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Customer A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こっちからも煙が！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's smoke over here too!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "客Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Customer B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、これ……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what is...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳がもらった袋からも炎が上がっておる！\nナンパ者であるかは無関係であろう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flames are rising from Chitose's bag as well! Clearly it has nothing to do with being a philanderer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、これってどういうこと！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what's going on?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "テス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "落ち着け！\u3000身を低くして煙を吸わないようにしろ！\n布を口元に当てて、慌てず避難だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay calm! Get low and don't breathe in the smoke! Cover your mouth with cloth and evacuate without panicking!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あわわ……に、逃げなきゃ！\nこういうときこそ「おかし」だよね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-whoa... W-we have to get out! Remember the fire safety rules!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "押さない、駆けない、喋らない……\nほ、ほら、イザナちゃんも一緒に避難しよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't push, don't run, don't talk... C-come on, Izana, let's evacuate together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ううん、アタシはマクダを手伝うよ。\nレスナちゃんは先に行ってて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...No, I'm going to help Magda. You go on ahead, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、でも……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? But...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫、アタシは責任を持って\nみんなを無事に脱出させるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's okay. I'll make sure everyone gets out safely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（イザナちゃん……そっか、騎士だもんね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Izana... Right, she's a knight.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、分かった！\u3000さすが騎士様！\nみんなをお願い！\u3000でもイザナちゃんも気を付けて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay! That's our knight! I'm counting on you to help everyone! But be careful!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナちゃん、騙してごめんね。\n\u3000でも、これも任務だから……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'm sorry for lying to you, Resna. But this is part of the mission...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナちゃんには後でちゃんと謝ろう。\n\u3000そのためにも、やることをやろう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'll apologize to her properly later. For now, I need to focus on what I came here to do.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]